Author       SWR FUSS~
Ranges       61 100 61 100
Economy      0 0
ResetMsg     A cold wind rises from deep within the ruins, carrying whispers of the ancient dead.~
ResetFreq    6
Flags        ~
#ENDAREADATA


#MOBILE
Vnum       15000
Keywords   sith spirit ancient~
Short      an ancient Sith spirit~
Long       The translucent form of an ancient Sith spirit drifts here, radiating malice.
~
Desc       This spirit has lingered for millennia, bound to the ruins by hatred and
unfinished dark purpose. Its eyes burn with cold fire and its form ripples
like smoke in a wind only it can feel. It regards you with contempt.
~
