Long       A vicious Sith hound prowls here, its eyes glowing red.
~
Desc       Corrupted by years of exposure to dark side energies, this creature is
barely recognisable as natural. Its hide has thickened to near-armour and
its claws can tear through durasteel. It regards you as prey.
~
Race       Human~
