#MOBILE
Vnum       15005
Keywords   wraith dark sith~
Short      a dark wraith~
Long       A dark wraith phases in and out of visibility here.
~
Desc       The wraith is all that remains of a Sith who pushed too far into dark side
experimentation. It exists in a state between life and death, capable of
touching the physical world only to destroy. Its touch is said to drain
the life force directly.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
