#MOBILE
Vnum       15006
Keywords   sith lord darth ruins~
Short      the Lord of Kar'ethis~
Long       The Lord of Kar'ethis stands here, an immovable presence of absolute darkness.
~
Desc       This is no mere spirit or guardian. The Lord of Kar'ethis was once among the
greatest of all Sith lords, and even death has not diminished that power. Dark
lightning crackles along its fingertips and the very stone of the ruins bends
slightly toward it, as though even the physical world acknowledges its mastery.
Its eyes lock onto yours and you feel the cold certainty that it intends to
destroy you utterly.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
ActFlags   npc aggressive sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary truesight~
Stats1     2000 100 0 95 100 0
Stats2     75 75 2000
Stats3     0 0 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    25 25 25 25 25 25 0 100
Saves      -20 -20 -20 -20 -20
Speaks     common ancient~
Speaking   common ancient~
Immune     sleep charm~
#ENDMOBILE


#OBJECT
Vnum     15000
Keywords sith holocron dark~
Type     armor~
Short    a Sith holocron~
Long     A small pyramid-shaped Sith holocron pulses with dark energy here.~
Flags    magic~
WFlags   take hold~
Values   0 15 0 0 0 0
Stats    8 8000 800 0 0
Affect       -1 -1 8 13 0
Affect       -1 -1 8 14 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey    holocron sith pyramid~
ExDesc       This ancient Sith holocron contains centuries of dark side knowledge. It
pulses with a malevolent energy in your grip, and you can hear faint whispers
at the edge of your hearing when you hold it. The power it offers is
undeniable, but so is the sense that it is slowly studying you in return.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum     15001
Keywords sith blade dark corrupted~
Type     weapon~
Short    a corrupted Sith blade~
Long     A corrupted Sith blade lies here, vibrating faintly.~
Flags    magic~
WFlags   take wield~
Values   5 30 60 2 0 5000
Stats    8 12000 1200 0 0
Affect       -1 -1 10 13 0
Affect       -1 -1 10 14 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey    blade sith corrupted~
ExDesc       The metal of this blade has been saturated with dark side energy over
centuries. It hums faintly in your grip and feels almost eager to be used.
The edge is impossibly sharp and leaves a faint dark trail in the air.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum     15002
Keywords sith robes dark ancient~
Type     armor~
Short    ancient Sith robes~
Long     A set of ancient Sith robes lies here in a crumpled heap.~
Flags    magic~
WFlags   take body~
Values   50 50 0 0 0 0
Stats    8 9000 900 0 0
Affect       -1 -1 -20 12 0
Affect       -1 -1 3 4 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey    robes sith ancient~
ExDesc       These robes have been imbued with protective dark side energy over
generations of use by powerful Sith. They are surprisingly light and move
almost like liquid. Strange runes are stitched into the lining in thread
that seems to absorb light rather than reflect it.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum     15003
Keywords sith amulet dark power~
Type     armor~
Short    a Sith power amulet~
Long     A Sith power amulet rests here, radiating cold dark energy.~
Flags    magic~
WFlags   take neck~
