Affect       -1 -1 4 5 0
Affect       -1 -1 5 13 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey    amulet sith power~
ExDesc       Carved from a black stone found only deep in Sith tombs, this amulet
channels dark side energy directly into the wearer. It grows warm against
the skin and you feel subtly stronger while wearing it, though the dreams
it brings are deeply unsettling.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum     15004
Keywords sith tome grimoire ancient~
