Affect       -1 -1 3 4 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey    grimoire tome sith~
ExDesc       The pages of this grimoire are made from a material that is decidedly not
paper. The script shifts slightly when you are not looking directly at it.
Reading it imparts a deep sense of forbidden knowledge along with a faint
but persistent headache.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

